    "description": "Handcrafted Turned Wood Ballpoint Pens - Set of 3\nArtisan Woodworking, Fine Writing Instruments\nThis collection features three custom hand-turned wooden ballpoint pens showcasing natural hardwood figure and polished finishes. Each pen displays distinct artisanal lathe work, ranging from a substantial cigar-style barrel with two-tone accents and inlay detailing to ergonomically contoured slimline profiles with rich burl and grain patterns. Complemented by gold-tone metal hardware and pocket clips, these handcrafted writing instruments offer both functional appeal and craftsmanship.\nItems Included:\nWide-body twist ballpoint pen with natural wood barrel, diagonal inlay band, black cap and grip accents, and decorative textured gold-tone center band with logo hangtag\nErgonomically contoured turned hardwood twist ballpoint pen with flared center profile, rich medium wood grain, and polished gold-tone hardware\nContoured figured burl wood twist ballpoint pen with pronounced taper, warm reddish-brown chatoyancy, and polished gold-tone hardware with logo hangtag\nCondition:\nAll three pens are in good condition. The polished wood barrels and glossy surfaces show no cracks, marks, scratches, or stains. Gold-tone trim, clips, and tips are clean and intact with bright finishes. Two pens retain their original maker logo hangtags.\nAll items are sold as-is. Condition, completeness, and functionality may vary. Items may not be fully tested, authenticated, sorted, or inventoried unless explicitly stated in the listing. For bulk, lot, or miscellaneous listings, contents can include a mix of brands, types, and conditions, and there are no guarantees regarding specific items included.\nAutographs and signatures have not been authenticated unless otherwise noted.\nWatches and electronics may not be tested for full functionality and may only be tested for power on, if at all.\nDue to the nature of these items, no returns or refunds will be accepted for condition, completeness, or functionality. Buyers are responsible for reviewing all photos and descriptions and must address any questions or concerns prior to bidding or purchase. By placing a bid or completing a purchase, you agree to these terms.\nFor jewelry orders only:\nCombined shipping is available for multiple items but must be requested through customer service prior to completing payment. This process is not automatic, and no refunds will be issued for combined shipping after payment has been processed.\nPlease note:\nWhat is pictured is what is in the box/bag. As this is an assorted bulk jewelry items, there are no guarantees in regards to the items included and condition. This will contain some combination of mismatched, damaged, craft/costume jewelry, and accessories. Note that the auctions are typically shipped in bulk and not packaged individually. This auction is not available for closer examination or additional information or pictures beyond what has been disclosed. Coin lots have been sorted as to not contain any US coins or currency or non-monetary items. However, a few may be missed and could be included.\nNo returns or refunds will be accepted for this auction. By placing a bid on this auction, you accept this as a condition of the sale.\nOversized Prints, Paintings & Framed Artwork – Shipping Disclaimer\nSome oversized prints, paintings, and framed artwork may be listed as",
